@startuml UC5_ManageTeam_Activity
title UC5 - Manage Team (Activity Diagram)
note
  **Under Development** — No dedicated TeamScreen exists.
  Team management is currently handled inline:
  - Adding: CatchService.ExecuteCapture() adds to Player.PokemonTeam
  - Switching in battle: BattleScreen calls IBattleService.CanSwitchPokemon()
  - Healing: StoryService.HealTeamAtCenter() heals all team members
end note

start
:Player views team (planned feature);
:Read Player.PokemonTeam from GameSession;
:Display team roster (up to 6 Pokemon);

note
  Planned future features:
  - View detailed Pokemon stats
  - Swap positions in team
  - Release Pokemon
  - Move Pokemon to/from box
  Currently not implemented as
  a standalone screen or service.
end note

stop
@enduml
